    { "id": "note-overview", "type": "note", "position": { "x": -680, "y": 0 },
      "data": { "noteKind": "text",
                "noteContent": "Iris is 150 rows, four measurements and three species: the smallest table that still needs every step of a real tabular pipeline. After a run the Print shows one mean per feature. z-scoring put every column of the whole table at zero, and the 120-row training split keeps them there, within about 0.03. A mean far from zero would mean the split is not representative -- raise test_size, or turn stratify off, to see that happen.\n\nIris 有 150 列、四個量測欄位、三個品種，是還用得上完整表格流程的最小資料集。跑完之後，Print 會印出每個特徵一個平均值。z-score 把整張表的每一欄都拉到 0，120 列的訓練集也留在 0 附近，誤差大約 0.03 以內。某一欄離 0 很遠，就表示這次切分不夠有代表性 — 把 test_size 調大，或把 stratify 關掉，就看得到。",
                "noteColor": "#3d3d1a", "boundToNodeId": "start-1",
                "boundOffset": { "x": -420, "y": 0 }, "noteWidth": 360 } },
    { "id": "note-split", "type": "note", "position": { "x": 740, "y": -270 },
      "data": { "noteKind": "text",
                "noteContent": "stratify keeps all three species at the same proportion in both halves. With 50 rows per species and a 30-row test set, turning it off can hand you a test set that is missing a species entirely.\n\nstratify 讓三個品種在訓練集與測試集裡的比例一致。每個品種 50 列、測試集只有 30 列，關掉之後有可能整個品種都沒被抽到。",
                "noteColor": "#3d3d1a", "boundToNodeId": "split",
                "boundOffset": { "x": 0, "y": -270 }, "noteWidth": 300 } }
  ],
